1
00:00:27,789 --> 00:00:29,831
好吧 这也太难受了
Well, that was harrowing.

2
00:00:30,331 --> 00:00:31,331
现在还不安全
We're not in the clear yet.

3
00:00:31,498 --> 00:00:32,831
我们需要搜完整座宫殿
We still have to search this whole thing

4
00:00:32,873 --> 00:00:35,998
在黄金特工把我们炸碎前找到奥斯卡
and find Oscar before the Ace Ops blow us to pieces.

5
00:00:36,289 --> 00:00:37,831
我们要怎么找到奥斯卡?
How are we supposed to find Oscar?

6
00:00:38,081 --> 00:00:42,748
这就像是 大鲸捞针
It's going to be like finding a needle in a giant whale.

7
00:00:42,914 --> 00:00:44,664
之前我们怎么会觉得这是个好主意?
Why did we think this was a good idea?

8
00:00:45,414 --> 00:00:47,664
我我或许能帮上忙
I, I might be able to help.

9
00:00:47,956 --> 00:00:51,581
我大概能感应到每个人的情绪
I can sense spikes of people's emotions, I think.

10
00:00:51,914 --> 00:00:53,581
在温特的舰上时我做到过
It happened on Winter's ship.

11
00:00:53,831 --> 00:00:55,748
如果我集中元气 就能维持这个能力
If I focus my Aura, I can keep it up.

12
00:00:56,581 --> 00:00:58,206
好吧 是个新功能
Okay. That's new.

13
00:00:58,748 --> 00:01:00,789
或许其中一个情绪就是奥斯卡的
Maybe one of them is Oscar.

14
00:01:01,123 --> 00:01:03,373
我能大概感应到他们在哪 但不知道是谁
I can sort of tell where they are, but not who.

15
00:01:04,206 --> 00:01:05,956
但他们都差不多在一个方位
They're more or less in the same area though.

16
00:01:06,373 --> 00:01:08,081
在更深处 我能带路
Further in. I can lead.

17
00:01:08,248 --> 00:01:10,456
嘿 你不需要把自己的力量榨干
Hey, you don't have to drain yourself.

18
00:01:10,789 --> 00:01:12,123
我也能帮忙
I can help too.

19
00:01:13,373 --> 00:01:16,373
是啊 是个好想法 谢谢
Yeah, good thinking. Thanks.

20
00:01:17,206 --> 00:01:20,581
那就带路吧
Well, lead the way.

21
00:01:29,123 --> 00:01:31,623
她没有在意自己满身的伤
She brushed off her bumps and bruises,

22
00:01:32,581 --> 00:01:35,164
因为没有什么比她心中的孤独感 更加疼痛
for nothing hurt worse than the loneliness in her chest.

23
00:01:35,581 --> 00:01:37,081
我知道的
I recognize that,

24
00:01:37,581 --> 00:01:39,289
「从世界坠落的女孩」
The Girl Who Fell Through The World?

25
00:01:40,664 --> 00:01:41,831
我并不惊讶
I shouldn't be surprised

26
00:01:41,873 --> 00:01:43,831
你对童话故事如此了解
you're so familiar with fairytales.

27
00:01:43,873 --> 00:01:45,831
我曾亲身经历过不少
I've lived through my share of them.

28
00:01:47,164 --> 00:01:48,081
你感觉如何?
How are you holding up?

29
00:01:49,414 --> 00:01:51,664
我曾以为从树不子坠落
I thought the idea of falling through Remnant

30
00:01:51,873 --> 00:01:54,581
进入新世界应该是非常令人激动的
into a new world was exciting.

31
00:01:55,414 --> 00:01:59,873
我从未明白为何她 回到家后会那么难过
I never understood why she was so sad when she finally made it back home.

32
00:02:00,831 --> 00:02:03,998
但现在我能理解了
But now it makes more sense.

33
00:02:04,539 --> 00:02:06,498
她已不再是从前的自己
She wasn't the same girl anymore.

34
00:02:08,123 --> 00:02:08,706
是啊
Yeah.

35
00:02:09,914 --> 00:02:13,373
我想我们的分裂计划
I think this plan to divide

36
00:02:13,414 --> 00:02:15,373
可以告一段落了
might have run its course.

37
00:02:15,873 --> 00:02:18,123
我们该思考下 如何离开这里
It's time we start thinking about a way out.

38
00:02:18,748 --> 00:02:22,456
没有魔杖 我们的选项少了不少 所以
Not having our cane certainly limits the options, so.

39
00:02:22,498 --> 00:02:26,164
不 我不喜欢我们使用魔法时发生的事
No, I don't like what happens when we use magic.

40
00:02:27,664 --> 00:02:31,664
每次用魔法 我都能感觉到我们融合得更快了
Every time we use it, I can feel us merging faster.

41
00:02:32,581 --> 00:02:34,831
我还没准备好
I'm not ready for that.

42
00:02:36,373 --> 00:02:37,373
我并不怪你
I don't blame you.

43
00:02:38,123 --> 00:02:41,206
说真的 我觉得你自己已经很不错了
Honestly, I think you're doing just fine on your own.

44
00:02:52,331 --> 00:02:53,873
听好了各位
Listen up everyone.

45
00:02:53,914 --> 00:02:55,498
我们要为载荷保持着陆点清场
We're keeping this LZ clear for the payload

46
00:02:55,539 --> 00:02:57,081
我们要把载荷送上去
we're going to put aboard that thing.

47
00:02:57,289 --> 00:02:58,873
若我们无法完成任务
If we can't hold this line,

48
00:02:58,914 --> 00:03:01,206
它将会继续吐出更多戮兽 我们则会失去这座城市
it will continue to spit out Grimm and we lose the city.

49
00:03:01,539 --> 00:03:02,664
明白了么?
Is that understood?

50
00:03:02,706 --> 00:03:03,581
是 长官
Yes ma'am.

51
00:03:05,164 --> 00:03:07,914
你应该不会知道适合这种情况的曲子吧?
You wouldn't happen to know a tune for this, huh?

52
00:03:08,289 --> 00:03:09,998
没人会知道的吧
I don't know that anybody does.

53
00:03:10,289 --> 00:03:11,831
又来了一波
Another wave incoming.

54
00:03:11,873 --> 00:03:13,831
把它们挡住
Keep them back.

55
00:03:14,914 --> 00:03:16,289
动起来!
Move, move, move!

56
00:03:16,498 --> 00:03:19,414
可他们还是孩子
But, they're just kids.

57
00:03:19,706 --> 00:03:21,873
你晚点再犯矫情
You can hash out your issues later.

58
00:03:22,039 --> 00:03:24,748
现在 只管杀戮兽
Right now, just kill Grimm.

59
00:03:37,873 --> 00:03:39,206
你为什么把我带到这儿?
Why did you bring me here?

60
00:03:41,914 --> 00:03:44,289
我想过你说的话
I've been thinking about what you said.

61
00:03:45,206 --> 00:03:47,873
如果你在说谎 而我将这个谎言带给塞伦
If it's a lie and I took that lie to Salem,

62
00:03:48,831 --> 00:03:51,414
她会先惩罚我
the punishment would fall on my head before yours.

63
00:03:53,331 --> 00:03:56,998
如果你说的是实话 而我自己用了密码
If what you said is true and I used the password myself,

64
00:03:57,873 --> 00:04:02,039
我也不知道这东西启动后会发生什么
well, I don't know what happens when this thing activates.

65
00:04:03,289 --> 00:04:05,206
所以我们来看看 你是不是在耍嘴皮子
So let's see if you're bluffing.

66
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:08,123
你想要我召唤她?
You want me to summon her?

67
00:04:08,998 --> 00:04:11,998
无论如何它都能给我我想要的答案
Either way, it'll tell me what I need to know.

68
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:13,998
你在干什么?
What are you doing?

69
00:04:20,748 --> 00:04:22,039
马上就知道了
Let's find out.

70
00:04:27,831 --> 00:04:28,956
珍
Jinn.

71
00:04:42,581 --> 00:04:44,956
哎呀 又见面了 老男人
Why, hello again, old man.

72
00:04:44,998 --> 00:04:46,956
你有什么问题要问我吗?
Did you have a question for me?

73
00:04:49,831 --> 00:04:53,873
其实 我的问题已经有答案了
Actually, I think all my questions are answered now.

74
00:04:54,914 --> 00:04:56,123
你准备做什么?
What are you going to do?

75
00:04:57,498 --> 00:04:59,039
做格蕾琴会做的事
What Gretchen would have done.

76
00:05:00,123 --> 00:05:02,206
首先就是将你带出去
And that starts with getting you away from here.

77
00:05:03,248 --> 00:05:03,998
把你们俩都带出去
Both of you.

78
00:05:07,373 --> 00:05:09,414
离开之前我还需要些东西
I'm going to need something before I go.

79
00:05:09,581 --> 00:05:15,164
我就确认一下 你们都不想问我问题?
So just to be clear, none of you have a question for me?

80
00:05:15,706 --> 00:05:18,206
不 但我们会将你一起带走
No, but we'll be bringing you with us.

81
00:05:19,373 --> 00:05:20,914
我们移动它的那一刻
The moment we move that thing,

82
00:05:21,456 --> 00:05:22,748
这个地方就会进入警戒状态
this place goes on high alert.

83
00:05:23,914 --> 00:05:25,498
最好是先把你带出去
Better to get you out first.

84
00:05:25,748 --> 00:05:26,289
可是
But.

85
00:05:26,748 --> 00:05:27,956
我会回来带走它
I'll come back for it.

86
00:05:28,831 --> 00:05:30,789
反正她也不知道密码是什么
Not like she knows the password anyway.

87
00:05:55,289 --> 00:05:56,539
抱歉
Sorry.

88
00:05:57,039 --> 00:05:58,914
不是你的错
It's not your fault.

89
00:05:59,206 --> 00:06:00,914
我们要一边隐匿自己一边追踪别人
I'm masking/and tracking at the same time.

90
00:06:00,956 --> 00:06:01,998
你们要歇一下吗?
Do you guys need a minute?

91
00:06:02,706 --> 00:06:04,914
我们不知道还剩下多少时间
We don't know how much longer we have.

92
00:06:04,956 --> 00:06:06,623
不如你先别隐匿了吧?
Why don't you give masking a break?

93
00:06:06,664 --> 00:06:08,539
我可以听你的指示先探路
Give me directions and I can scout ahead.

94
00:06:08,581 --> 00:06:12,248
谢了!我们应该还有一段直路要走的
Thanks. We should be heading straight for awhile.

95
00:06:16,206 --> 00:06:18,123
至少你们和好了
Well at least you guys being friends again

96
00:06:18,539 --> 00:06:20,831
感觉我们不会完蛋了
takes the sting out of impending doom.

97
00:06:21,373 --> 00:06:23,289
害怕也没关系的 其实
It's okay to be afraid, you know.

98
00:06:25,373 --> 00:06:27,789
不用总是把它隐藏在笑话后面
You don't always have to hide it with a joke.

99
00:06:28,956 --> 00:06:30,748
知道不只有自己一个人害怕真好
Glad I'm not the only one who's scared.

100
00:06:31,081 --> 00:06:32,706
我当然怕啊
Of course I'm scared,

101
00:06:32,956 --> 00:06:33,998
但是他呢
him on the other hand.

102
00:06:35,039 --> 00:06:36,123
他一点都不怕
There's no fear at all.

103
00:06:36,706 --> 00:06:40,331
我看得出来 他确信我们做得到
I can see it, he believes we're going to get this done.

104
00:06:42,248 --> 00:06:43,206
那么我也信
Then I do too.

105
00:06:48,289 --> 00:06:49,831
莲 遮蔽我们!
Mask us, Ren!

106
00:07:17,373 --> 00:07:19,623
你确定他一个人没问题吗?
You sure he'll be okay on his own?

107
00:07:19,998 --> 00:07:23,539
不知道 总之我们得.. 慢着
! don't know, we just need to get... wait!

108
00:07:30,248 --> 00:07:34,456
是黑泽尔啊 你搞到我们要的东西了吗?
Ah, Hazel, have you gotten what we need yet?

109
00:07:35,456 --> 00:07:39,748
我 我 这..
I, I, uh.

110
00:07:43,331 --> 00:07:46,581
是眼兽 看来我们有访客了
The Seers, seems we have guests.

111
00:07:47,748 --> 00:07:50,248
神灯 找他们出来!
The lamp, find them!

112
00:07:55,998 --> 00:07:57,206
现在怎么办?
What now?

113
00:07:57,414 --> 00:08:00,789
就做我们最擅长的事吧一头莽进危险里!
Let's do what we do best, charge blindly into danger.

114
00:08:00,831 --> 00:08:04,664
本来想说继续前进 不过好吧 莲
Would've gone with keep moving forward, but sure. Ren.

115
00:08:05,123 --> 00:08:07,081
前进 不顾一切
Forward, no matter what.

116
00:08:25,123 --> 00:08:25,831
乖!
Stay!

117
00:08:28,498 --> 00:08:29,831
炸弹还要多久搞定?
How much longer for the payload?

118
00:08:29,873 --> 00:08:31,373
已经接近着陆点了
It's approaching the LZ now.

119
00:08:35,664 --> 00:08:37,081
快点啊 强
Come on, Juan.

120
00:08:44,664 --> 00:08:45,414
是你
You.

121
00:08:45,498 --> 00:08:47,456
别 等等 别动手
No, wait, stop!

122
00:08:50,498 --> 00:08:51,248
奥斯卡!
Oscar!

123
00:08:55,664 --> 00:08:58,706
我就觉得感应到弱小的心灵了
I knew I sensed some weak minds nearby.

124
00:08:59,164 --> 00:09:00,914
发生什么事了
What's going on here?

125
00:09:01,373 --> 00:09:02,539
说来话长了
It's a long story.

126
00:09:02,664 --> 00:09:04,748
你可得尽量长话短说
You're gonna have to try and summarize it.

127
00:09:05,039 --> 00:09:06,456
为什么我们要相信你?
Why should we trust you?

128
00:09:06,831 --> 00:09:08,706
因为她在害怕
Because she's scared,

129
00:09:11,206 --> 00:09:12,373
和我们一样
just like us.

130
00:09:15,664 --> 00:09:17,831
也许是因为我知道怎么逃出去
Or maybe because I know how to get out of here.

131
00:09:19,289 --> 00:09:20,456
有人想跟来吗?
Anybody coming?

132
00:09:28,748 --> 00:09:30,081
时候到了 各位
This is it, everyone.

133
00:09:30,414 --> 00:09:32,164
我们杀出一条路 到那怪物跟前
We're going to clear a path to that monster.

134
00:09:32,664 --> 00:09:33,831
将炸弹运上去
We get the payload aboard,

135
00:09:34,081 --> 00:09:35,623
开始计时 然后撤离
set the timer, and then we're out.

136
00:09:37,873 --> 00:09:40,039
他们可能还在里面
They might still be alive in there.

137
00:09:40,081 --> 00:09:41,123
我已经给他们时间了
I gave them their window!

138
00:09:41,873 --> 00:09:42,914
我们不能再等了
We can't wait any longer.

139
00:09:43,289 --> 00:09:45,789
如果里面是你妹妹的话 你还会这样说吗?
Would you say the same thing if it was your sister inside?

140
00:09:46,873 --> 00:09:49,289
你能告诉他你对她朋友做了什么吗?
Are you gonna tell her what you did to her friends?

141
00:09:53,498 --> 00:09:56,373
我会 马洛 因为这是我的使命
Yes, Marrow, because that's my duty.

142
00:09:58,623 --> 00:10:00,123
你也尽你的那份吧
Now you do yours.

143
00:10:09,748 --> 00:10:10,539
我们快出去了!
We're almost out!

144
00:10:13,831 --> 00:10:15,373
那是什么啊?
What is that?

145
00:10:17,831 --> 00:10:18,664
是她
It's her.

146
00:10:34,664 --> 00:10:37,831
你的外像力还真有好好锤炼呢
You really have been honing that Semblance of yours.

147
00:10:59,789 --> 00:11:00,831
放开她们!
Let them go!

148
00:11:16,456 --> 00:11:18,289
你对神灯做什么了?
What did you do with the lamp?

149
00:11:19,331 --> 00:11:20,873
什么都没做
Nothing.

150
00:11:22,998 --> 00:11:24,623
神灯不见了
It's missing.

151
00:11:25,331 --> 00:11:26,623
神灯在哪里?
Where is it?

152
00:11:26,664 --> 00:11:28,623
我没碰过
I didn't do anything with it.

153
00:11:29,289 --> 00:11:31,039
在哪里?
Where is it?

154
00:11:38,623 --> 00:11:41,331
你看你变得多卑微
Look how you've diminished.

155
00:11:41,873 --> 00:11:44,914
你变得多渺小 又为了什么?
How you've lessened yourself, and for what?

156
00:11:45,164 --> 00:11:47,998
这群小孩 这坏掉了的世界?
These children, this ruined world?

157
00:11:53,373 --> 00:11:58,998
你为什么要一次又一次地回来?
Why do you keep coming back?

158
00:11:59,039 --> 00:12:00,998
你呢?
Why do you?

159
00:12:02,789 --> 00:12:04,456
无止境的死亡
All of this endless death

160
00:12:05,164 --> 00:12:08,248
就为了你很久很久以前不幸过一次?
because something bad happened to you once upon a time?

161
00:12:08,998 --> 00:12:10,873
没有人能有童话式的结局
Nobody gets a fairy tale ending.

162
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:17,206
我失去的一切 失去的所有人
Everything I've lost, every person I've lost

163
00:12:17,831 --> 00:12:19,206
都是因为你
is because of you.

164
00:12:19,914 --> 00:12:22,831
我又夺去了你的谁啊 女孩?
And who is it I've taken from you, girl?

165
00:12:23,581 --> 00:12:26,331
Summer Rose 我的妈妈
Summer Rose, my mom.

166
00:12:29,248 --> 00:12:30,873
又是她
Her again.

167
00:12:31,164 --> 00:12:32,331
女王大人
Your grace.

168
00:12:33,914 --> 00:12:38,331
黑泽尔 我找到我们的访客了
Ah, Hazel. I found our guests.

169
00:12:38,581 --> 00:12:39,664
不!
No!

170
00:12:41,123 --> 00:12:43,289
她在帮助他们
This one was helping them.

171
00:12:45,956 --> 00:12:48,373
带男孩回他的房间里
Take the boy back to his chamber.

172
00:12:48,914 --> 00:12:51,581
我要处理这位
I have work to do with this one.

173
00:12:52,164 --> 00:12:54,373
是的 当然
Yes, of course.

174
00:13:09,873 --> 00:13:12,206
别再提格蕾茵了 小子
No more Gretchens, boy.

175
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:20,456
我真的不知道
I really don't know.

176
00:13:39,373 --> 00:13:41,164
快跑 马上!
Go now!

177
00:13:49,539 --> 00:13:50,206
黑泽尔
Hazel.

178
00:13:55,414 --> 00:13:56,081
去吧
Go.

179
00:13:59,414 --> 00:14:01,789
所以 过了这么久
So, you've decided against vengeance

180
00:14:01,831 --> 00:14:03,789
你才决定放弃为妹妹复仇
for your sister after all this time.

181
00:14:05,373 --> 00:14:07,956
我是在做格蕾茵会做的事
I'm doing what Gretchen would have done.

182
00:14:42,706 --> 00:14:44,123
快 大家快跑!
Come on, everyone out!

183
00:14:45,289 --> 00:14:46,956
等等 奥斯卡?
Wait, Oscar?

184
00:14:48,414 --> 00:14:49,831
她只会继续追杀我们
